Bug: p is computed from the absolute position (r*CH+dr)*w + (c*CW+dc), and then used as an index into px[r*CH+dr][...] — double counting the row. p should just be (c*CW+dc)*3 + ... . That's the bug: p can be way out of bounds → segfault.

